hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27675","Haddathana Affan, he said: Haddathana Abu Awanah, he said: Haddathana Zayd ibn Jubayr, and a man asked him, meaning Ibn Umar, about what the muhrim kills of beasts, so he said: One of the wives of the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, informed me that he commanded the killing of the mouse, the scorpion, the vicious dog, the kite, and the crow."
